#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:4
msgid "QbsDeps"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:6
msgid ""
"The ``QbsDeps`` generator produces the necessary files for each dependency "
"to be able to use the qbs ``Depends`` item to locate the dependencies. It "
"can be used like:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:9
msgid ""
"from conan import ConanFile\n"
"\n"
"class App(ConanFile):\n"
"    settings = \"os\", \"arch\", \"compiler\", \"build_type\"\n"
"    requires = \"hello/0.1\"\n"
"    generators = \"QbsDeps\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:19
msgid ""
"It is also possible to use ``QbsDeps`` manually in the ``generate()`` method:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:21
msgid ""
"from conan import ConanFile\n"
"from conan.tools.qbs import QbsDeps\n"
"\n"
"class App(ConanFile):\n"
"    settings = \"os\", \"arch\", \"compiler\", \"build_type\"\n"
"    requires = \"hello/0.1\"\n"
"\n"
"    def generate(self):\n"
"        deps = QbsDeps(self)\n"
"        deps.generate()"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:34
msgid ""
"The dependency to the application can be added using the ``Depends`` item:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:36
msgid "**project.qbs**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:36
msgid ""
"CppApplication {\n"
"    Depends { name: \"hello\"; version: \"0.1\" }\n"
"    files: \"main.c\"\n"
"    qbs.installPrefix: \"\"\n"
"    install: true\n"
"    qbsModuleProviders: \"conan\"\n"
"    moduleProviders.conan.installDirectory: \"build\"\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:49
msgid ""
"By default, for a ``hello`` requires, you need to use ``Depends { name: "
"\"hello\" }``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:51
msgid ""
"Note that we are setting the ``qbsModuleProviders`` property to "
"``\"conan\"`` in order to tell Qbs that dependencies are generated by Conan. "
"We also set the ``installDirectory`` property of the ``conan`` module "
"provider to ``\"build\"`` to tell the provider to look for generated files "
"in the ``build`` directory within the source directory. It is also possible "
"to set this value from command line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:57
msgid "We install dependencies using the ``conan install`` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:59
msgid "$ conan install . --output-folder=build --build missing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:63
msgid "Finally, we can build the project by simply calling Qbs:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:65
msgid "$ qbs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:69
msgid ""
"Note, that Qbs helper will automatically set the ``conan.installDirectory`` "
"property when QbsDeps generator is used."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:74
msgid "Check the :ref:`Qbs helper <conan_tools_qbs_helper>` for details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:80
msgid "Properties"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:82
msgid "The following properties affect the ``QbsDeps`` generator:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:84
msgid ""
"**qbs_file_name**: Name of the generated Qbs module for the current package. "
"The generator creates a ``<VALUE>.json`` file, and consumers use ``Depends "
"{ name: \"<VALUE>\" }``. By default this is the package name, or "
"``pkg_config_name`` if that property is set. Use ``qbs_file_name`` to "
"override the module name."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:89
msgid "Example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:91
msgid ""
"def package_info(self):\n"
"    ...\n"
"    # Generates MyFirstLib.json, consumed as: Depends { name: "
"\"MyFirstLib\" }\n"
"    self.cpp_info.set_property(\"qbs_file_name\", \"MyFirstLib\")"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.rst:100
msgid "Reference"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../conan_sources/conan/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.py:docstring of
#: conan.tools.qbs.qbsdeps.QbsDeps:1
msgid ""
"This class will generate a JSON file for each dependency inside the \"conan-"
"qbs-deps\" folder. Each JSON file contains information necesary for Qbs "
"``\"conan\" module provider`` to be able to generate Qbs module files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../conan_sources/conan/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.py:docstring of
#: conan.tools.qbs.qbsdeps.QbsDeps:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../conan_sources/conan/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.py:docstring of
#: conan.tools.qbs.qbsdeps.QbsDeps:5
msgid "The current recipe object. Always use ``self``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../conan_sources/conan/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.py:docstring of
#: conan.tools.qbs.qbsdeps.QbsDeps.content:1
msgid ""
"Returns all dependency information as a Python dict object where key is the "
"dependency name and value is a dict with dependency properties."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../conan_sources/conan/tools/qbs/qbsdeps.py:docstring of
#: conan.tools.qbs.qbsdeps.QbsDeps.generate:1
msgid ""
"This method will save the generated files to the \"conan-qbs-deps\" "
"directory inside the ``conanfile.generators_folder`` directory. Generates a "
"single JSON file per dependency or component."
msgstr ""
